{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nameless adventurer, you must go to meet a stranger and accept his terms of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/338db136c8e0ac84289e392a33bd791c.poster.avif?t=1755297350\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/338db136c8e0ac84289e392a33bd791c.webm?t=1755297350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/338db136c8e0ac84289e392a33bd791c.mp4?t=1755297350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hear a voice from the pitch darkness, inviting you to play a deadly game where your life is at stake. Solve puzzles, unravel mysteries, use your wits to overcome all obstacles. But be careful: every wrong step can lead to unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/8f3b67eedb839c093cae268661be76d4.poster.avif?t=1755297350\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/8f3b67eedb839c093cae268661be76d4.webm?t=1755297350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908440/extras/8f3b67eedb839c093cae268661be76d4.mp4?t=1755297350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908440?t=1755297350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.